            <title>[IGNITE-12846] Docs: few packages have no description in binary release</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12846</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Documentation does not contain description block for following packages:&lt;br/&gt;
org.apache.ignite.ml.composition.bagging&lt;br/&gt;
 org.apache.ignite.ml.inference.json&lt;br/&gt;
 org.apache.ignite.ml.knn.utils.indices&lt;br/&gt;
 org.apache.ignite.ml.util.plugin;&lt;br/&gt;
 org.apache.ignite.spi.discovery.isolated&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;e.g.&lt;br/&gt;
 Actual:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&amp;lt;/tr&amp;gt;
